.vercel
node_modules
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Secrets and local environment. HF_KEY lives in .env.local and never in the repo.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.venv/

# seo/internal-links-suggested.json is NOT ignored. It stopped being advisory
# the moment gen/autolink.py started reading it: it is now a build input, and a
# build input that is not committed is a build that differs per machine.

# seo/triage-result.json is deliberately NOT ignored. The safety judgements are
# the record of which terms this business was cleared to target and which it was
# not, opportunities.py refuses to queue a term that has no judgement, and
# re-asking the same 120 questions every morning costs money to learn nothing.

# docs/ff96f1785ed213b9701cc8c01e681cb1.txt is deliberately NOT ignored, and it
# is not a credential. IndexNow works by making you publish the key at the site
# root, so that anyone submitting URLs for this host has demonstrably written to
# it. Ignoring the file, or moving the key into a secret, breaks the submission
# the moment the file stops being fetchable. seo/indexnow-state.json is also not
# ignored: it is the record of what has already been submitted, and without it
# every run re-sends 91 unchanged URLs, which is the documented way to have
# your submissions discounted.
